Q1 — Patient Screening

A clinical study has the following patients:

subject <- c("SUB001","SUB002","SUB003","SUB004","SUB005",
             "SUB006","SUB007","SUB008")

age <- c(25,62,48,71,35,55,67,60)

weight <- c(58,74,63,81,69,72,79,76)

The study team wants to identify patients who are 60 years or older and weigh at least 75 kg.

Your program should return the subject IDs meeting both criteria.

Expected result:

SUB004 SUB007 SUB008
Q2 — Treatment Selection

