               "DrugA","DrugC","DrugA","DrugB","DrugC")

A clinical programmer is asked to create a reusable tool for the study team.

The tool must answer these three questions at the same time:

Which patients are 60+ years old?
Which patients weigh 75 kg or more?
Which patients received DrugA?

The study team wants all three answers returned together so they can review them easily.

